===Etymology 3===
The noun is from {{inh|en|enm|spelt}}, from {{inh|en|ang|spelt}}, connected with the verb. Compare {{m|en|speld#Noun}} and {{cog|de|Spelze|t=husk}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=4651212990}}</ref>

The adjective is from {{inh|en|enm|spelt}}, probably a contraction of {{m|enm|spelked}}, past participle of {{m|enm|spelken|t=to bruise (beans)}},<ref name="OED adj.">{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=4208723499}}</ref> itself of obscure origin.<ref name="OED spelk">{{R:OED Online|entry=spelk|pos=''v.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=1385021501}}</ref> Compare {{cog|sco|spilkings|t=split peas}},<ref name="OED spelk"/> the later verb, and perhaps also {{m|en|splet}}.<ref name="OED adj."/>

The verb is probably from the adjective. Compare earlier {{m|en|spald#Verb}}, {{m|en|speld#Verb}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=v|id=1024637013}}</ref>

